# Site Reliability Engineering - Part 1: SRE and Organizational Culture

> Published at 2023-08-18T22:43:47+03:00

I work as a Site Reliability Engineer (SRE). In this blog series, I want to write down what SRE is about from my point of view. It's a mix of tech, culture and a lot of persistence, and there's never a boring day. This first part is about SRE and organizational culture.

